WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:31.250
So far we have received
 considerable knowledge 

2
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:33.958
from Lord Krishna about Him.

3
00:00:33.958 --> 00:00:36.500
Now in the next verses, we will understand

4
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.250
how this knowledge

5
00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:39.041
shows us the path

6
00:00:39.041 --> 00:00:41.291
of surrender toward Him,

7
00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:43.875
and along with this, we will also know

8
00:00:43.875 --> 00:00:46.875
who will be able to surrender to Krishna

9
00:00:46.875 --> 00:00:49.083
and who will not.

10
00:00:49.083 --> 00:00:51.750
After understanding the previous
 many verses, perhaps

11
00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:54.000
a natural question is also

12
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.500
in many people's minds –

13
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.166
if Krishna is everywhere,

14
00:00:58.166 --> 00:01:01.166
then why isn't He visible?

15
00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:03.833
This thirteenth verse of the seventh chapter

16
00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:05.458
is the answer to this.

17
00:01:10.291 --> 00:01:12.625
In this verse, Krishna explains

18
00:01:12.625 --> 00:01:15.583
that the entire world and every being

19
00:01:15.583 --> 00:01:17.458
is under the influence of nature's three guṇas –

20
00:01:17.458 --> 00:01:20.916
sattva, meaning purity and goodness,

21
00:01:20.916 --> 00:01:24.333
rajas, meaning passion and desire,

22
00:01:24.333 --> 00:01:28.333
and tamas, meaning ignorance.

23
00:01:28.333 --> 00:01:32.166
These three guṇas blur human wisdom.

24
00:01:32.166 --> 00:01:35.916
Just as when wearing colored glass spectacles,

25
00:01:35.916 --> 00:01:37.791
everything appears colored,

26
00:01:37.791 --> 00:01:40.125
similarly the influence of these guṇas

27
00:01:40.125 --> 00:01:43.041
distorts our perspective,

28
00:01:43.041 --> 00:01:44.791
corrupts it.

29
00:01:44.791 --> 00:01:47.333
We don't see the complete truth.

30
00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:50.083
Whereas Krishna is beyond these guṇas,

31
00:01:50.083 --> 00:01:52.791
He is infinite, indestructible.

32
00:01:52.791 --> 00:01:55.875
This means that time, space,

33
00:01:55.875 --> 00:01:57.000
and the guṇas

34
00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.500
of the material world

35
00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:00.416
have no effect on Krishna.

36
00:02:00.416 --> 00:02:02.708
He Himself creates this world,

37
00:02:02.708 --> 00:02:04.333
handles everything,

38
00:02:04.333 --> 00:02:08.208
but Himself doesn't get entangled
 in these guṇas.

39
00:02:08.208 --> 00:02:10.666
Whereas humans get entangled in the influence

40
00:02:10.666 --> 00:02:14.625
of these guṇas, and cannot recognize Krishna.

41
00:02:14.625 --> 00:02:17.291
Now the question arises that if these three guṇas

42
00:02:17.291 --> 00:02:20.000
keep us trapped in a snare,

43
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.541
then how can liberation from them be obtained?

44
00:02:22.541 --> 00:02:24.916
Krishna will give its answer in the next verse,

45
00:02:24.916 --> 00:02:26.333
where He will explain

46
00:02:26.333 --> 00:02:29.000
that by walking on the path
 of surrender and devotion,

47
00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.458
we can rise above the influence of these guṇas.

48
00:02:32.458 --> 00:02:35.291
For now, the essence of this verse is this –

49
00:02:35.291 --> 00:02:39.000
these three guṇas of sattva, rajas, and tamas

50
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.416
influence our intellect, because of which

51
00:02:42.416 --> 00:02:45.208
we can neither see Krishna

52
00:02:45.208 --> 00:02:47.125
nor know His infinite,

53
00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:49.166
indestructible form.

54
00:02:49.166 --> 00:02:53.750
And if we must understand
 Krishna in His true form,

55
00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:57.500
then we must rise above these guṇas.

56
00:03:02.333 --> 00:03:05.041
In this world,

57
00:03:05.041 --> 00:03:06.666
sattva

58
00:03:06.666 --> 00:03:08.375
rajas

59
00:03:08.375 --> 00:03:12.250
and tamas

60
00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:14.291
these three gunas

61
00:03:14.291 --> 00:03:21.375
put such a veil on your intellect

62
00:03:21.375 --> 00:03:25.833
that you cannot see Me,

63
00:03:25.833 --> 00:03:29.416
cannot understand Me.

64
00:03:29.416 --> 00:03:32.250
But not only this,

65
00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:34.375
these very three guṇas also

66
00:03:34.375 --> 00:03:36.708
have an effect on your hopes,

67
00:03:36.708 --> 00:03:39.666
on your mind's peace,

68
00:03:39.666 --> 00:03:43.291
on your thinking.

69
00:03:43.291 --> 00:03:48.083
They distort your perspective,

70
00:03:48.083 --> 00:03:51.875
because of which the true image of life

71
00:03:51.875 --> 00:03:54.291
isn't visible.

72
00:03:54.291 --> 00:03:59.750
Sometimes you feel that you're stuck

73
00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:02.458
or the problem is so big

74
00:04:02.458 --> 00:04:06.541
that its solution isn't possible.

75
00:04:06.541 --> 00:04:08.791
But remember,

76
00:04:08.791 --> 00:04:11.083
you're not stuck,

77
00:04:11.083 --> 00:04:14.291
and nor is there any problem

78
00:04:14.291 --> 00:04:18.291
whose solution isn't possible.

79
00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:22.666
This is an illusion

80
00:04:22.666 --> 00:04:25.000
arising from these three guṇas.

81
00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:27.166
These guṇas don't only

82
00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:31.958
distance you from My existence,

83
00:04:31.958 --> 00:04:36.625
but also separate you from your own power.

84
00:04:36.625 --> 00:04:39.333
Many times you start feeling

85
00:04:39.333 --> 00:04:45.250
that there's darkness everywhere
 in life, trouble.

86
00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:46.875
In such times,

87
00:04:46.875 --> 00:04:49.291
it's necessary to know

88
00:04:49.291 --> 00:04:54.000
that this darkness is only māyā's web.

89
00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.250
This trouble,

90
00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:59.291
this darkness isn't permanent.

91
00:04:59.291 --> 00:05:02.291
What's needed is only this much –

92
00:05:02.291 --> 00:05:06.000
that you light the light of spirituality.

93
00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:09.208
Because only the light of spiritual

94
00:05:09.208 --> 00:05:12.875
knowledge can break this darkness.

95
00:05:12.875 --> 00:05:15.208
And the simplest way to illuminate

96
00:05:15.208 --> 00:05:20.291
this knowledge is

97
00:05:20.291 --> 00:05:23.000
My remembrance.

98
00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:26.000
Whenever you remember Me,

99
00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:30.625
this light will be around you.

100
00:05:30.625 --> 00:05:32.458
Because

101
00:05:32.458 --> 00:05:36.416
I was never far from you,

102
00:05:36.416 --> 00:05:39.666
I was here with you.

103
00:05:39.666 --> 00:05:42.500
You just couldn't see Me

104
00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:46.416
because of this worldly web of māyā.

105
00:05:46.416 --> 00:05:49.000
Come to My shelter.

106
00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:52.250
I am always present

107
00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:53.750
to show you the right path.

108
00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:58.375
I am that light which will never be extinguished,

109
00:05:58.375 --> 00:06:00.916
will erase every darkness.

110
00:06:00.916 --> 00:06:05.166
What's needed is only My remembrance

111
00:06:05.166 --> 00:06:09.083
and surrender toward Me.

112
00:06:14.166 --> 00:06:16.541
In today's society,

113
00:06:16.541 --> 00:06:20.541
attraction toward materialism
 has increased so much

114
00:06:20.541 --> 00:06:25.125
that people have come to consider
 the desire and ignorance

115
00:06:25.125 --> 00:06:27.958
born from rajas and tamas

116
00:06:27.958 --> 00:06:30.958
as the purpose of life itself.

117
00:06:30.958 --> 00:06:32.916
These are the two guṇas

118
00:06:32.916 --> 00:06:36.583
that bind humans in the web

119
00:06:36.583 --> 00:06:40.500
of never-ending material attachments.

120
00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.958
Humans feel that

121
00:06:42.958 --> 00:06:45.958
if they just get a little more wealth,

122
00:06:45.958 --> 00:06:50.458
a little more property, a little more 
material pleasure,

123
00:06:50.458 --> 00:06:54.333
then their success will be complete,

124
00:06:54.333 --> 00:06:56.541
but this never happens.

125
00:06:56.541 --> 00:06:59.833
This attachment just keeps increasing.

126
00:06:59.833 --> 00:07:01.291
Just as

127
00:07:01.291 --> 00:07:06.708
someone is searching for water
 in a desert mirage, similarly people

128
00:07:06.708 --> 00:07:12.291
are running after wealth, position, and pleasure.

129
00:07:12.291 --> 00:07:15.291
But

130
00:07:15.291 --> 00:07:17.958
the mirage's water

131
00:07:17.958 --> 00:07:20.625
is an illusion

132
00:07:20.625 --> 00:07:23.750
that won't quench thirst.

133
00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.250
Just like this,

134
00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:30.083
material attachments are also such an illusion

135
00:07:30.083 --> 00:07:35.500
that can never give complete satisfaction.

136
00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:39.750
Everywhere, advertisements
 just seem to promote

137
00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:42.583
which new thing, which new

138
00:07:42.583 --> 00:07:45.791
experience will bring happiness.

139
00:07:45.791 --> 00:07:47.458
But are

140
00:07:47.458 --> 00:07:50.875
people truly happy?

141
00:07:50.875 --> 00:07:54.041
In modern society, stress, anxiety,

142
00:07:54.041 --> 00:07:58.791
and sadness are at their peak.

143
00:07:58.791 --> 00:08:02.416
The irony is that in search of this false

144
00:08:02.416 --> 00:08:06.541
happiness, people waste
 so much of their energy,

145
00:08:06.541 --> 00:08:10.541
time, and peace.

146
00:08:10.541 --> 00:08:12.625
Whereas true happiness

147
00:08:12.625 --> 00:08:16.500
was always with them,

148
00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:19.083
within them.

149
00:08:19.083 --> 00:08:22.500
You will have to look within yourself.

150
00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:27.166
This knowledge of the Gita will help you in that.

151
00:08:27.166 --> 00:08:30.541
Will introduce you to your soul,

152
00:08:30.541 --> 00:08:35.125
will bring you close to Me.

153
00:08:35.125 --> 00:08:38.500
Remove this web of māyā of material pleasures,

154
00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:42.083
and understand that immense happiness, peace,

155
00:08:42.083 --> 00:08:45.250
and satisfaction

156
00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.750
are within you.

157
00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.000
For this,

158
00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.958
recognize the spiritual purpose of life.

159
00:08:51.958 --> 00:08:56.750
And to achieve this purpose,

160
00:08:56.750 --> 00:09:04.041
I am always with you to help you.

161
00:09:04.041 --> 00:09:07.916
You just need to recognize Me,

162
00:09:07.916 --> 00:09:10.208
come to Me.

163
00:09:10.208 --> 00:09:13.791
And this Gita is that map

164
00:09:13.791 --> 00:09:17.375
which is bringing you step by step

165
00:09:17.375 --> 00:09:19.291
to Me.

166
00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:27.291
Every person has their own perspective.

167
00:09:27.291 --> 00:09:30.458
The reason for this can be anything –

168
00:09:30.458 --> 00:09:33.625
their experiences, their samskāras,

169
00:09:33.625 --> 00:09:37.166
the ideology in which they grew up.

170
00:09:37.166 --> 00:09:41.000
And then this very perspective
 influences their thinking,

171
00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:45.458
their decisions, and behavior.

172
00:09:45.458 --> 00:09:48.875
In such a case, seeing the truth
 of any circumstance

173
00:09:48.875 --> 00:09:52.708
becomes difficult for people many times.

174
00:09:52.708 --> 00:09:55.541
And this very thing also becomes

175
00:09:55.541 --> 00:09:59.541
the cause of conflict in the
 business world many times.

176
00:09:59.541 --> 00:10:01.166
Think,

177
00:10:01.166 --> 00:10:03.416
what an irony.

178
00:10:03.416 --> 00:10:06.208
Truth is before everyone,

179
00:10:06.208 --> 00:10:10.458
but everyone sees it differently,

180
00:10:10.458 --> 00:10:13.583
gives different reactions.

181
00:10:13.583 --> 00:10:16.583
Just as the three guṇas of sattva, rajas,

182
00:10:16.583 --> 00:10:19.250
and tamas

183
00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:23.500
don't let humans see spiritual truth,

184
00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:25.000
similarly,

185
00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:26.125
at the workplace too,

186
00:10:26.125 --> 00:10:30.291
differences arise for this very reason
 – because everyone

187
00:10:30.291 --> 00:10:35.333
remains bound in their limited perspective.

188
00:10:35.333 --> 00:10:38.666
Everyone considers only their
 own thinking as truth.

189
00:10:38.666 --> 00:10:43.208
But just as, beyond these three guṇas,

190
00:10:43.208 --> 00:10:47.333
truth can be known by taking shelter in Me,

191
00:10:47.333 --> 00:10:50.708
similarly, in professional settings too,

192
00:10:50.708 --> 00:10:54.500
by rising above one's narrow perspective,

193
00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:57.625
the truth of the situation can be understood.

194
00:10:57.625 --> 00:10:59.791
For this, first of all,

195
00:10:59.791 --> 00:11:02.666
this humility must be brought

196
00:11:02.666 --> 00:11:06.125
that truth can also be

197
00:11:06.125 --> 00:11:10.166
that which is different from your thinking.

198
00:11:10.166 --> 00:11:11.333
This humility

199
00:11:11.333 --> 00:11:14.000
will give you the ability

200
00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.958
to see others' perspective.

201
00:11:15.958 --> 00:11:17.791
After that,

202
00:11:17.791 --> 00:11:22.375
rising above mutual differences, it must be seen

203
00:11:22.375 --> 00:11:25.041
what is appropriate for the organization

204
00:11:25.041 --> 00:11:28.250
and from the perspective of human welfare.

205
00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:33.083
When everyone humbly makes the purposes
 of organization and human welfare

206
00:11:33.083 --> 00:11:36.958
their focal point,

207
00:11:36.958 --> 00:11:40.416
then it will help in finding the right solution.

208
00:11:40.416 --> 00:11:42.166
And yes,

209
00:11:42.166 --> 00:11:43.375
just as

210
00:11:43.375 --> 00:11:44.875
to rise above the guṇas

211
00:11:44.875 --> 00:11:48.583
of sattva, rajas, and tamas,

212
00:11:48.583 --> 00:11:51.750
you must come to My shelter,

213
00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:55.791
similarly, when some business solution

214
00:11:55.791 --> 00:11:59.125
isn't understood, then taking guidance

215
00:11:59.125 --> 00:12:03.291
from some trusted senior officer
 is also appropriate.

216
00:12:03.291 --> 00:12:07.291
So just keep these three things in mind –

217
00:12:07.291 --> 00:12:10.583
During business differences, remain humble,

218
00:12:10.583 --> 00:12:12.708
so that you can see the truth.

219
00:12:12.708 --> 00:12:14.333
Discuss openly,

220
00:12:14.333 --> 00:12:17.333
perhaps a solution will be found.

221
00:12:17.333 --> 00:12:19.583
And if still not found,

222
00:12:19.583 --> 00:12:22.791
then take help from your senior officers.

223
00:12:22.791 --> 00:12:27.166
Know that they have more experience.

224
00:12:27.166 --> 00:12:32.250
They will be able to understand the 
situation more deeply and better than you.

225
00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:35.000
Will be able to suggest the right solution.
